Z||000000||CanadianGT||06-18-2001||07:46 PM||||Every saturday night at the Canadian Tire here in Oakville, there is a cruise night/ car show for all different types of cars.  I was not able to make it as I was busy breaking my hand in a fight at a party ( im such an idiot), but my buddies went and said they saw two of the sweetest  Fieros ever.  He said one of them was a beautiful red, that was supercharged, and had a shot of nitrous as well.   It also had the window scoops.  I was wondering if that is anyones car here?  My friend is a Mustang Freak, and whenever I bring up my Fiero, he just laughs at  it, but with this one he was really impressed, and showed it the respect that all Fieros deserve.  I would love too see this one for myself too!  Anyone???????<BR>PeAcE<BR>Kyle||||reg||1
